  "description": "This is some stuff from the 1990s. I'm not supposed to share it. On BBS, or use it to make money. But libraries for free are licensed/ok. GOOD THING! Or else I couldn't post this here, the repercussions would be far more than I could handle.<div><br /></div><div>I think they went out of business back in the twenty-aughts. Sez my WaybackMachineo skillz0rx.</div><div><br /></div><div>I like the cigarette commercials. I wish there were more in here. Granted, it's no wonder people hate big tobacco. It was like, the most advertised product ever. Lots of competitors in the market you see, easy crop, high profitability, strong customer loyalty. The ROI I mean.</div><div>Many of these advertisers are still staples to this day. I have some Colgate gum care right here. I haven't bled from gingivitis in weeks, so, I brush dry for now. I shave dry too. Who needs products, that they don't need?</div><div><br /></div><div>I'm using keywords from my Mozilla directory to see if they SEO you or not. HOW EXCITING! AN EXPERIMENT!</div><div><br /></div><div>-JJ</div>",
